# Reproducibility

Every experiment must record:
- git commit
- config
- random seeds
- dataset seed
- model initialization seed
- codec
- matching regime
- model parameter count
- token count
- optimizer steps
- FLOPs estimate
- dataset version/checksum

Never use uncontrolled global randomness.

A result is not valid unless another run can reproduce the same generated episode
from the same world seed.
